<title>HONG KONG: Deutsche Bank sets Lai Sun Dev warrants.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank sets Lai Sun Dev warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG said on Wednesday it has launched 380 million American style call warrants on shares of Lai Sun Development Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$10.125    PREMIUM	 17.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.31275   GEARING	 3.6X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  13.NOV.98    LISTING DATE  27.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$11.25</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
